      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The current debug menu is really just not usable in VR at all (or it is, but it's WAY too inconvenient for a game called VR-Chat) . Biggest change I'd wanna see is making you able to actually scroll trough it in VR, 2nd would be to re-do the UI so I can actually see what is going on in my avatar without having to scroll up and down all the time, specifically the param list can get very long very quickly and so making that maybe a separate part of the menu with it's own scroll bar or something would be nice. Or maybe adding more than 1 column of parameters? I'm no UI expert lol",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
